-- title:
--   Local work (round six, `locWork_le_vol`)
-- statement:
--   **Local work** `≤ nloc · (W+T) · |states|`, i.e. `≤ (nloc (W+T)²/W) · V` with the data
--   volume `V = W · 2^{m|κ|}`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6CxCost`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.Cx.Prop8IfaceH.locWork_le_vol (J : Prop8IfaceH W T m h) (κ : Type) [Fintype κ]
--       [DecidableEq κ] :
--       (J.locWork κ : ℝ) ≤ ((J.net.filterMap HStep.locR).length * ((W + T : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ 2 / W) *
--         (W * 2 ^ (m * Fintype.card κ))
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** R2: cost of the recursive C-layer through a `Prop8IfaceH` network (moment recurrence)
--
--   Cost model (§5.3, as `Butterfly.recCost`, now on any number of axes `e = m f + r`): a node on
--   `e ≥ m` axes and data volume `V` costs `Lloc · V` for the local steps of one network invocation
--   (`locWork_le_vol`: `Lloc = nloc (W+T)²/W` bounds the actual entry operations), `r · V` for the
--   `r = e mod m` leftover individual kernels, and one recursive call on `|S| f` axes and volume
--   `V / W` per child; a leaf (`e < m`) costs `e · V` (individual kernels).
--
--   * `recCostH_lin`: `recCostH e V = V · recCostH e 1`.
--   * `recCostH_unit_node`: the per-volume recurrence `c(e) = Lloc + r + (1/W) ∑_w n_w c(w f)`.
--   * **`recCostH_le`**: if `∑_w n_w (w/m)^σ < W` (`histMoment h m σ < W`), then
--     `recCostH e V ≤ K · V · e^σ` for all `e, V ≥ 0` (via `moment_recurrence_bound` applied to the
--     running maximum of `c`).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** Part of the Lean formalization of the round-six κ-improvement (integer-multiplication-kappa campaign, target `IntMul.Kappa.jain_round6_framework`). The statement is copied verbatim from the Lean development; the platform node carries the same declaration name. Definitions it mentions live in the `IntMul_Kappa_R6_Defs*` bundles (on top of the published κ bundles `IntMul_Kappa_K_Defs*`).
